# Webleau

Spatial node/link canvas (Liquid Space / `LQS`). Read `AGENTS.md` for architecture.

## Change policy

- Nothing is sacred: refactor freely; no BC unless asked.
- Prefer deleting old paths over shims.
- Ask when the end state is ambiguous; otherwise implement fully.

## Baseline

- Session core: `server/session/` (layout + events + `sessions/*.json`).
- Web adapter: `server/http.ts` (static + REST + WS) — live authority.
- MCP adapter: `server/mcp.ts` (stdio → HTTP API). Requires `npm start`.
- Browser: `index.html` + `js/lqs/`; sync via `session-sync.js`.
- Run: `npm start` → http://127.0.0.1:8787

## When architecture changes

Update `AGENTS.md` and these rules.
